    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "plate_towns",
      "label": "Delivery towns",
      "info": "One per line. Only the name is required: write \"Waukesha|53186\" and the place is looked up automatically. Add |left%|top%|lat|lng columns only for exact placement. Add the word kitchen as the fifth column on your base row. Leave empty for the built-in Hartland list."
    },
